      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77ed7ba528417fe8",
      "translationZh": "为 Amazon Bedrock 的 Mantle 端点向 Claude 应用网关添加了 mantle 上游提供商",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e738fb95d6cd9ee",
      "translationZh": "修复了当轮次提前结束时，SDK 会话会丢失延迟工具调用或已完成工具结果的问题，并修复了 worker 重启后保留的审批提示以及非流式回退模式的 result.usage 问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be3a0b5b3d373cf6",
      "translationZh": "修复了长时运行的工具调用移至后台后，MCP 进度通知被丢弃的问题；现在后台任务会显示最新的进度",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78d3c98d06b4433c",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 stdio MCP 服务器在启动过程中会话结束时，导致服务器仍处于运行状态的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "883ea5552ad14a19",
      "translationZh": "修复了无状态远程 MCP 服务器（例如重新部署中的代理）产生的短暂 HTTP 404 错误，导致该服务器在会话剩余时间内虽显示为已连接但无法使用的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb93fcff1a74bfd2",
      "translationZh": "修复了没有有效 URL 的服务器在进行 MCP 登录时会触发模糊 SDK 错误的问题；/mcp 不再为这类服务器提供身份验证选项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35953be1313b1d8f",
