      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3940f4794189705c",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 plain id 被拒绝的情况下，当 id 带有日期或 -v1:0 后缀时，/model 仍能接受带有 [1m] 的 Sonnet 4.6 或 Sonnet 5 的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8499ea83da7f992",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL 固定为不同模型时，/model 选择器仍显示硬编码的 Haiku 版本和价格的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f6e8968fadd8230",
